 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I've been hiding an injury. I'm ashamed and I can't stop.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I buried this before the Scattering. Seemed stupid to keep it secret.\" Priya digs up a wrapped bundle — food, still good. (+1423 kcal to the pantry.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"This one — Cashew. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"a burned farmhouse — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind? That's my read.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Do you ever just need to be alone? Like, really alone?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"That's enough for now. It'll percolate.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I asked Felicia about the sickness I'm fighting — Felicia's gone. Still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"The fever's not breaking and I'm barely keeping food down. I need help — real help, not just water.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Dwayne owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I greet everyone by name each morning. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Dwayne's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"What's the kindest thing someone's done for you out here? Good talking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Right, so — That's the good stuff. Quiet generosity. It's holding this whole thing together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"an old trapline — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on the kindest thing someone's done for you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Moving! But — good talk! More later!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Never mind the sickness I'm fighting — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"No, really — it's handled. Thanks for asking, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "Somchai: \"Hey — come here. You should hear this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"This one — Neem. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Can I trust you? I mean really.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"That's the right answer. The wrong one would've been 'yes' too fast.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Still on whether they can trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Okay I really have to move now or I'll explode — talk soon!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "You said you'd earn it, not that I should just hand it over. Fair. I'm watching — and so far, so good."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "You walk to the cache spot with Somchai. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"a ridge with a view for miles — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"Tell you what — Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"Gotta run. Literally. Bye!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what they confided — that was 11 days back. Still on your mind? 'Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind? That's my read.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"This one — Wild Garlic. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"...Anyway. What did you want to ask?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"My wound needs a second pair of hands. Will you help me clean it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"Every day it's angrier. I need it cleaned before it turns — I can't work a wound like this. Wrap it tight when you're done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"No, yeah, of course. Forget I asked.\" They won't forget. They'll just stop asking."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"Still on that wound care.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "They give you the benefit of the doubt. This time."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Priya grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 52,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I saw something in the woods I'm not telling anyone about.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that favor.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"You told me about people sharing food they couldn't spare. Quiet. No performance. Seen it again since?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "They settle in like someone glad you're here."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"This one — Lotus Root. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"This one — Fonio. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"As I said — we're still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Never mind the pantry run — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. Water's almost gone — 0 liters. I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 0 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"...Okay. I'll figure it out.\" They won't ask twice. That much is clear."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 68,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Do you still count the days? I lost track days ago. Can't sit still, you know?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Good. Keep counting. The days need witnesses.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Still on what day it is.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? Gotta keep moving.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Theo rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"What got you through the first week? The very first days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Shock's underrated. It's the body's way of buying you time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Abhishek?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"It's my spouse, Abhishek. Was taken at the Scattering. I tell everyone they were the interesting one. I need that to be true. The pods get into my sleep some nights."
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "Row on row of them, humming like a held note -- and I wake up reaching for something that isn't there.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Miguel always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Another time. The village needs me here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Okay — I need to move. But I'm glad we talked.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"I asked Elena about what you're good at — Elena's gone. What's something you're good at that nobody here knows about? You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Noted. Filing that under 'extremely useful.' The village needs that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Still on what you're good at.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Okay I really have to move now or I'll explode — talk soon!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Did you need something?\" Their voice is flat."
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "text": "They nod, already turning away."
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"About what happened to my taken kin — I keep dreaming about rows of pods. Humming. Tell me I'm not the only one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Still nothing on Abhishek. I told you about the pods -- I keep thinking about them. The humming. Some nights I'm sure it's a dream. Other nights I'm sure it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"The whole fire was arguing about The Reunion last night — what to even CALL it. 'The Big Bastard' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "🤝 Heritier is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"You know what — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "You show them Groundnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Has this changed you? Like, fundamentally? Not that it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"The old you got you here. The new you keeps you here. Both count!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Still on how this changed you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Another time. The village needs me here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Right. Action time. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 91,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about that taken person — that was 11 days back. Still on your mind? 'Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"I can't reach this properly. Could you take a look?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"It keeps getting worse. I can't haul or hunt with it like this — and if it festers, I'm done for. Please, clean it out and bind it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Ximena is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"I'm picking up Ximena's share of the work. Someone should, and it might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "🤝 Heritier is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Like I said — we're still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "You show them Spicebush — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"About this wound — still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Every day it's angrier. I need it cleaned before it turns — I can't work a wound like this. Wrap it tight when you're done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Ximena was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I sleep with one ear uncovered, always at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"Okay — I need to move. But I'm glad we talked.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 102,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
