    "bearerSample": [
     "🪵 Trong hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (1438 logs now.)",
     "💬 Trong mutters: \"Smile for the sky, they said. I hate how easy it was to start doing it.\""
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "You notice the village gives you room on the path now. Not fear, exactly. Room.",
     "💛 You hold Dispatcher's headset. You learned the voice — low, steady, unhurried. 'Panic is just information arriving too fast.' You hear it in your own voice now when it counts. Your gifts are not ma",
     "✨ Ability gained: Fusion Reactor (L1). The System installs your fusion pellet — properly, inside you. You never need to eat again: the pellet covers your metabolism, and your strikes and abilities bur"
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
     "A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."
    ],
    "crisisSample": [
     "◈ Somchai doesn't boast. They don't have to. Everyone can see it.",
     "FUSION REACTOR: the pellet goes in — properly, inside you. A warm hum starts behind your ribs and settles. You will never be hungry again. One reactor per world: yours. It does not come out. (The Syst",
     "◈ Something in Priya's eyes has changed. They've seen enough out there to stop being afraid of the dark."
    ]
   },
